WEBVTT

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.213
Our abilities to survive
the climate crisis.

00:01:33.131 --> 00:01:34.674
Pressure is building.

00:01:35.842 --> 00:01:40.847
At COP26 last year,
governments, NGOs, corporations

00:01:40.888 --> 00:01:44.392
all say yes to protecting forests
and land rights

00:01:44.433 --> 00:01:49.730
and call on Indigenous peoples,
guardians of standing forests, for help.

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.067
Finally, we all agree.

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:56.154
We work with the people who know how,

00:01:56.154 --> 00:01:57.488
in my father's words.

00:01:58.156 --> 00:02:02.285
Over 20 years ago in my own hometown
in southern Philippines,